<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>FS 7601 Camps — Enchantments Basecamp</name>
    <description>Two dispersed camp spots on Forest Service Road 7601 (Eightmile Road) near Leavenworth, WA, plus the Eightmile Trailhead for reference. Coordinates are approximate; verify signage on arrival.</description>

    <Style id="primary">
      <IconStyle><color>ff54b4c4</color><scale>1.1</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/grn-circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="backup">
      <IconStyle><color>ff3a62b5</color><scale>1.0</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/ylw-circle.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>
    <Style id="trailhead">
      <IconStyle><color>ffb0a36b</color><scale>0.9</scale>
        <Icon><href>http://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon>
      </IconStyle>
    </Style>

    <Placemark>
      <name>Upper 7601 Camp (primary)</name>
      <styleUrl>#primary</styleUrl>
      <description>Primary pick. Roughly 2.4 mi up FR 7601, about 0.6 mi below Eightmile Trailhead and about 1.5 mi drive from the Stuart/Colchuck Trailhead. Part of the free "FS Road 7601 Dispersed" stretch: pull-offs with fire rings, creek access, no facilities. Outside the posted no-parking zone. Coordinates approximate.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>-120.80243,47.54021,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>

    <Placemark>
      <name>Lower 7601 Camp (backup — verify signage)</name>
      <styleUrl>#backup</styleUrl>
      <description>Backup only. Roughly 0.5 mi up FR 7601 from Bridge Creek Campground, which places it inside the mile 0.00-1.03 stretch covered by Forest Order 06-17-1991-221 (no parking where signs are posted, up to the road 115 junction). WTA also states dispersed camping is not allowed between FR 7601 and Icicle Creek. If you see No Parking signs, or the spot sits on the creek side of the road, move up-road past the road 115 junction.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>-120.78066,47.55733,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>

    <Placemark>
      <name>Eightmile Trailhead (reference)</name>
      <styleUrl>#trailhead</styleUrl>
      <description>USFS coordinates. About 3.1 mi up FR 7601. Self-issue day-use wilderness permits here. Parking is $5/vehicle/day or a Northwest Forest Pass / America the Beautiful pass. The Stuart/Colchuck Trailhead is a further 0.7-0.9 mi up the road; no verified coordinates for it, so it is deliberately left off this file rather than guessed.</description>
      <Point><coordinates>-120.81401,47.53601,0</coordinates></Point>
    </Placemark>
  </Document>
</kml>
